Domain Entity AssessmentBatteryPart
    documentation "The parts organized for administering an assessessment which together provide a comprehensive assessment of the students."
    domain entity Assessment
        documentation "A reference to the assessment."
        is part of identity
    shared string AssessmentBatteryPartName
        documentation "The name of the part of a assessment battery."
        is part of identity
    domain entity ObjectiveAssessment
        documentation "A reference to the objective assessment(s) that are administered by the assessment battery part."
        is optional collection